Z||000002||Formula88||12-20-2001||12:57 AM||||3000GT is a great car, but I've heard they are expensive to repair.  FYI.||||reg||1
Z||000003||FieroJones||12-20-2001||03:27 PM||||They are expensive to repair, and the AWD system is flawed.  They are always needing this, needing that, in for repairs, etc etc etc..   Besides, unless you BABY the crud outta those twin turbos,(IE: Give it the 5 minute Idle down at the end of the day, and the 10-15 min Warm up before) your gunna have more probs... <P>Just my 2cents from working on them||||reg||1
